@flexiarg efficiency/order-by-what-it-unlocks
@title Order Shared Pieces By What They Unlock, Recomputed When The Set Changes
@keywords foundation-ranking, dispatch-order, consumers-closed, topological-order, recompute
@audience decomposition planners, blueprint authors, packet writers, seat orchestrators
@tone technical
@style pattern
@status proposed (2026-10-19; drafted by claude-5 from PROPOSAL-2026-10-19.md after claude-14's redline, job invoke-1792417571913-17409-73886055; promotion gate: one further program that follows it and records the outcome)
@references [efficiency/split-by-shared-dependency efficiency/cover-every-row-or-say-why-not]
